        "original_id": "cc7d91f5-b922-530c-a711-97fa5693dc2e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. J. Singh, Kanwarjit Singh Sawhney, Shajith Koyeri, Subash Sahu, Vishal Bhardwaj, Gulzar\n- Places: Mumbai, India\n- Films: Omkara\n- Awards: 54th National Film Award for Best Audiography, Filmfare Award for Best Sound Design\n- Roles: audio engineer, director, composer, lyricist\n\nFacts:\n- K. J. Singh, also known as Kanwarjit Singh Sawhney, is an Indian audio engineer based in Mumbai.\n- Omkara is a 2006 film.\n- For Omkara, K. J. Singh won the 54th National Film Award for Best Audiography with Shajith Koyeri and Subash Sahu.\n- For Omkara, K. J. Singh won the Filmfare Award for Best Sound Design with Shajith Koyeri and Subash Sahu.\n- Vishal Bhardwaj directed Omkara and composed its entire music, including the background score.\n- Gulzar wrote the lyrics for Omkara.",
